<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<title>Happy New Year</title>
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

<style>
body{
    margin:0;
    height:100vh;
    background:#ff5f7e;
    display:flex;
    justify-content:center;
    align-items:center;
    font-family:Arial, sans-serif;
}

.card{
    background:white;
    padding:25px;
    border-radius:15px;
    text-align:center;
    width:90%;
    max-width:350px;
}

h1{
    color:#ff5f7e;
}

p{
    font-size:16px;
    color:#333;
}

button{
    margin-top:15px;
    padding:10px 20px;
    background:#ff5f7e;
    color:white;
    border:none;
    border-radius:20px;
    font-size:16px;
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<div class="card">
    <h1>🎉 Happy New Year 🎉</h1>
    <p>
        Is naye saal mein meri ek hi dua hai 💖  
        Tum hamesha khush raho aur muskurati raho ✨
    </p>
    <button onclick="alert('💖 Tum bohot special ho 💖')">
        Click Me
    </button>
</div>

</body>
</html>
